  "reason": "A1 attempt a01 staged the new API tree but returned the layer-name boolean false: the P5a flag layer and the admission-off layer share one prefix, and the revision 7 name rule found no name between them. Revision 8 adds one last candidate built from the P5a layer name (found on disk by its recorded digest), recognises the re-pin layer in two forms, and accepts the A1 a01 record for A2 use except its boolean, which the A2 gate re-derives. A1 does not run again; it keeps the revision 7 constants. The A2, A2M, RA and AR tools carry the revision 8 packet hash; Root set it after installation, which changed only that constant (checked by diff).",
